==Welsh==

===Letter===
{{infl|cy|letter|lower case||upper case|CH|mixed case|Ch}}

# ''[[èch]]'', the fourth letter of the Welsh alphabet, after ''[[c]]'' and before ''[[d]]''

====Usage notes====
Lke the other Welsh digraphs, {{term|ch}} is considered a distinct letter of the Welsh alphabet for all purposes, including collation.  Thus, {{term|chwech}} is alphabetically sorted '''after''' {{term|cyllell}}.

